@startuml activity
!include style.iuml
skinparam defaultFontSize 13

|Passenger|
start
:Arrive at the terminal\n(airline is known);
if (Self check-in?) then (yes)
  :Join a kiosk line;
else (no)
  :Join a counter line;
endif
note right
  If there is more than one
  line, join the shortest one
end note
|Check-in|
:Check in at a kiosk\nor with an agent;
|Passenger|
:Go to security checkpoint\n1 or 2 and join its line;
|Security|
:Screen carry-on bags;
if (Selected for a stop?) then (yes)
  :Extra check;
else (no)
endif
|Passenger|
:Leave for the gate;
stop
@enduml
